*0200
/
/SETUP POINTERS FOR AMOUNT OF EXTENDED
/BANKS OF MEMORY, INTERRUPT SERVICE, CURRENT
/FIELD , AND TESTS FOR CLASSIC PACKAGE OR APT SYSTEM.
/IF CONSOLE IS ACTIVE APT FUNCTIONS OR NOP.

/
BGN,	JMP .+3			/RUN DISKLESS
	MANUAL			/TO MANUAL SCOPE TEST
	IOTCHN			/TO IOT CHANGE ROUTINE
	RIF
	DCA HOMEMA
	TAD HOMEMA
	TAD KCDF		/MAKE HOMEDF
	DCA PRSFLD
PRSFLD,	HLT			/MAKE DF=IF
	SET			/SETUP FIELD 0
	TAD FLDMAX		/GET FIRST PASS POINTER
