/
/VERIFY THAT THE DISK MOTOR IS OFF. THE
/STATUS REGISTER SHOULD ONLY CONTAIN NOT READY TO
/SEEK, READ, OR WRITE AND NOT DISK FILE READY.
/INITIALIZE SHOULD HAVE CLEARED ALL OTHER BITS
/

	DCA REG1
	TAD STCON		/GET EXPECTED STATUS
	DCA GDREG2		/SETUP TEST HANDLER
