/MANUAL TEST FOR 16 BIT COUNTER.
/SET SWITCH REGISTER TO 0201 AND PRESS
/LOAD ADDRESS. SET THE SWITCH REGISTER TO 0000.
/THEN PRESS CLEAR AND CONTINUE.
/SCOPE THE 16TH CARRY OUTPUT TEST POINT
/FOR A GROUND TO +3 VOLT SIGNAL.
/
MANUL,	CLA CLL IAC
	CLRALL			/FIRST, CLEAR CONTROL
	ENMAN1			/ENTER MAINTENANCE MODE
	TAD K0100		/ENABLE SHIFT PULSES
	LDMAN			/ISSUE MAINTENANCE IOT AND
	JMP .-1			/CAUSE HI MAIN SHIFTS TO THE
	JMP .-2			/INPUT OF THE 16 BIT COUNTER.
/
/THIS ROUTINE WILL BE A SKIP INSTRUCTION FOR SYSTEMS WITHOUT CLASSIC
/OTHERWISE IT WILL EXECUTE THE NEXT INSTRUCTION IN FIELD 0 AND THEN
/SKIP THE INSTRUCTION AFTER THAT ONE.
/
CLASIK,	0
	DCA SAVAC		/SAVE CURRENT AC.
	TAD I CLASIK		/GET INSTRUCTION
	DCA ROUTMP		/SAVE THE CLASSIC ROUTINE.
	ISZ CLASIK		/BUMP AFTER THE CALL.
	TAD OP2
	AND (400
	SZA CLA			/IS THIS A CLASSIC SYSTEM?
	JMP .+3			/YES
	TAD SAVAC		/NO, THEN RETURN TO PROGRAM.
	JMP I CLASIK
	ISZ CLASIK
	CDF 10
	TAD SWR
	DCA I (SWR		/MOVE POINTERS TO FIELD 1.
	TAD OP1
	DCA I (OP1
	TAD OP2
	DCA I (OP2
	TAD ROUTMP
	DCA I (ROUINS		/SAVE ROUTINE IN FIELD 1.
	TAD SAVAC
	CIF 10
	JMP I (ROUINS		/GO EXECUTE ROUTINE.
/
