	TAD OP2
	AND K0400		/MASK CLASSIC.
	SZA CLA			/ON CLASSIC?
	KSF			/IF SO ALLOW KEY FLAG.
	JMP .+3			/NO KEY!
	KCC			/WAS CLEAR FLAG.
	JMP IONWT+1		/RETURN AND WAIT.
	CLASIC			/CHECK FOR CLASSIC.
