/SUBROUTINE FOR "ERRORS", SCOPE LOOPS, AND
/ERROR TYPEOUTS.
/
ERRO,	0
	CLA CLL
	AERRO			/REPORT ERROR TO APT IF NEED BE.
	TAD I ERRO		/GET SCOPE LOOP POINTER
	DCA SERRO		/SAVE FOR RETURN
	LAS			/GET SWR0
	SMA CLA			/IS IT SCOPE LOOP
	JMP .+10
	LAS			/GET SWITCH 2
	RTL
	SPA CLA			/INHIBIT ERROR BELL
	JMP I SERRO		/YES
